motivation: You can begin tired. The work only asks that you arrive and keep arriving.
discipline: Make the bed before your doubts wake up. Small promises keep their word.
money: Money grows quiet when you leave it alone; spend loudly and it disappears.
mindset: Not every thought deserves a microphone in my head.
fact: The human nose can detect over a trillion distinct scents.
books: The ability to concentrate without distraction is becoming rare, which makes it increasingly valuable.
stoic: Some things answer to you. The rest only asks to be carried.
